                <pb facs="0937" n="813" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg813"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 297.—Translation from the Le
                        Trait d’Union, November 1, 1881.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The Mexican Government has, it appears, been assured that 5,000 soldiers are
                    already on the Guatemala frontier. The Guatemalan Government is also sending a
                    considerable number of troops of the line upon her frontier.</p>
            </div>
